@filipesilva: I just added "npm run build:prod:debug" in case you need to use Chrome DevTools to debug the code. I would suggest you start looking at webpack.prod.ts to see if the config somehow is the error behind this. For example I have implemented Terser.

> @JonWallsten GLOBAL_DEFS_FOR_TERSER is meant to be imported by the build system, and sets ngDevMode to a hardcoded false.

Like in your build system, when you create the bundles för Angular, or when we build our bundles?
If it's the latter I guess there would be some possible explanation since we build in a custom way.

I think I get it now. Since we, Webpack users, aren't using ng build, we also need to implement `global_defs`.

